        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International GTP, Plain Base Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Safety Grab Bar is available in 6 finishes including polished brass, polished chrome, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel (click picture to the right to see them all). It is easy to install with the included hardware. Choose the size that suits your needs from 12 inches, 18 inches, 24 inches, 30 inches, 36 inches, and 42 inches. All of them have a 1-1/4 inch diameter except for the 36 inch and the 42 inch lengths which have a 1-1/2 inch diameter tube.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the RK International Plain Safety Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTP-1</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTP-2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTP-3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 26-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTP-4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 32-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTP-5</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 38-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTP-6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 44-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
